<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>キャンプギア図鑑 | CAMP LAB</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="manifest" href="data:application/manifest+json;base64,">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#2E5942">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Maru+Gothic:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Kiwi+Maru:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --forest:#2E5942;
    --forest-dark:#1F4030;
    --fire:#E9722C;
    --fire-light:#F3A65C;
    --sun:#F4BE3E;
    --canvas:#FBF3E1;
    --canvas-deep:#F2E5C8;
    --sky:#6FA9B8;
    --ink:#2B2620;
    --paper:#FFFDF8;
    --line:#DCCBA0;
    --radius-card: 18px 18px 18px 4px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--canvas);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Zen Maru Gothic','Kiwi Maru',sans-serif;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 12%, rgba(46,89,66,0.06) 0, transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 85%, rgba(233,114,44,0.08) 0, transparent 45%);
  }
  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header.hero{
    position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--forest) 0%,var(--forest-dark) 100%);
    color:var(--canvas);
    padding:28px 20px 46px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  header.hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;right:0;bottom:0;
    height:26px;
    background:var(--canvas);
    clip-path:polygon(0% 100%,0% 40%,4% 100%,8% 40%,12% 100%,16% 40%,20% 100%,24% 40%,28% 100%,32% 40%,36% 100%,40% 40%,44% 100%,48% 40%,52% 100%,56% 40%,60% 100%,64% 40%,68% 100%,72% 40%,76% 100%,80% 40%,84% 100%,88% 40%,92% 100%,96% 40%,100% 100%);
  }
  .hero-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .hero-top svg{width:34px;height:34px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .hero-top h1{font-size:22px;margin:0;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px;}
  .hero-sub{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--canvas-deep);max-width:520px;}
  .hero-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;}
  .hero-tag{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    padding:5px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;
  }
  /* ---------- Tabs ---------- */
  nav.tabs{
    display:flex;
    overflow-x:auto;
    gap:8px;
    padding:14px 14px 10px;
    position:sticky;top:0;
    background:var(--canvas);
    z-index:20;
    -ms-overflow-style:none;scrollbar-width:none;
  }
  nav.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  .tab-btn{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    padding:9px 16px;
    border-radius:100px;
    border:2px solid var(--forest);
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--forest);
    font-family:inherit;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:13px;
    cursor:pointer;
    white-space:nowrap;
    transition:transform .15s ease;
  }
  .tab-btn.active{
    background:var(--fire);
    border-color:var(--fire);
    color:white;
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--forest-dark);
  }
  main{padding:6px 16px 60px;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}
  section.panel{display:none;}
  section.panel.active{display:block;animation:fadeUp .35s ease;}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}

  h2.section-title{
    font-size:19px;
    margin:22px 0 12px;
    color:var(--forest-dark);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  }
  h2.section-title:first-child{margin-top:14px;}
  .flag{
    width:10px;height:10px;background:var(--fire);
    clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 50%,0 100%);
  }

  /* ---------- Search box ---------- */
  .search-box{
    display:flex;gap:8px;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:100px;
    padding:6px 6px 6px 16px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .search-box input{
    border:none;background:none;outline:none;
    font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;flex:1;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .search-box button{
    border:none;background:var(--sun);
    border-radius:100px;padding:8px 16px;font-weight:700;
    font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--forest-dark);
  }

  /* ---------- Dictionary ---------- */
  .term-card{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2px solid var(--canvas-deep);
    border-radius:var(--radius-card);
    padding:14px 16px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .term-card .term-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .term-card .term-jp{font-weight:900;font-size:16px;color:var(--forest-dark);}
  .term-card .term-en{font-size:11px;color:var(--sky);font-weight:700;}
  .term-card p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a4438;}
  .term-cat{
    display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;
    background:var(--forest);color:white;
    padding:2px 9px;border-radius:100px;margin-top:8px;
  }
  .term-cat.custom{background:var(--fire);}
  .term-remove{
    float:right;border:none;background:none;color:#b0a58c;
    font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;
  }

  /* ---------- 用語追加フォーム ---------- */
  .add-term-btn{
    width:100%;
    background:var(--sun);
    border:2px dashed var(--forest);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:11px;
    font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--forest-dark);
    cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .add-form{
    display:none;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2px solid var(--fire);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:14px 16px;
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .add-form.open{display:block;}
  .add-form-label{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12.5px;color:#5a5344;font-weight:700;}
  .add-form input, .add-form textarea, .add-form select{
    width:100%;
    border:2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:9px 12px;
    font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;
    background:var(--canvas);color:var(--ink);
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .add-form textarea{min-height:70px;resize:vertical;}
  .add-form-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .fetch-btn{
    flex:1;border:2px solid var(--sky);background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--sky);border-radius:10px;padding:9px;
    font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .fetch-status{font-size:11.5px;color:#9c9384;margin-bottom:8px;min-height:14px;}
  .save-btn{
    flex:1;border:none;background:var(--forest);color:white;
    border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;
    font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .cancel-btn{
    border:2px solid var(--line);background:none;color:#7a7261;
    border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;
    font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;
  }

  /* ---------- Gear cards (setup video) ---------- */
  .gear-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
  .gear-card{
    background:var(--paper);
    border-radius:16px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:2px solid var(--canvas-deep);
    box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--canvas-deep);
  }
  .gear-img{
    height:120px;width:100%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:44px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sky),#8fc4d0);
  }
  .gear-img.illustrated{
    background:var(--canvas-deep);
  }
  .gear-img.illustrated svg{
    width:88px;height:88px;
  }
  .gear-body{padding:12px 14px 14px;}
  .gear-body h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--forest-dark);}
  .gear-price{font-size:13px;color:var(--fire);font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .gear-meta{font-size:12px;color:#7a7261;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.6;}
  .video-link{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
    background:var(--forest);color:white;
    border-radius:100px;padding:8px 14px;
    font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;
  }
  .video-link:active{opacity:.8;}

  /* ---------- Combo tips ---------- */
  .tip-card{
    background:var(--paper);
    border-left:5px solid var(--fire);
    border-radius:4px 14px 14px 4px;
    padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 0 var(--canvas-deep);
  }
  .tip-card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--forest-dark);}
  .tip-card p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a4438;}
  .tip-source{
    display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--sky);font-weight:700;
  }
  .note-box{
    background:var(--sun);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:12px 14px;
    font-size:12px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--forest-dark);
    margin-bottom:16px;
    font-weight:500;
  }

  /* ---------- 設営/撤収手順 ---------- */
  .order-cols{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .order-block h4{
    margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--forest-dark);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  }
  .order-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;counter-reset:step;}
  .order-list li{
    counter-increment:step;
    position:relative;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2px solid var(--canvas-deep);
    border-radius:4px 14px 14px 14px;
    padding:10px 12px 10px 40px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4438;
  }
  .order-list li::before{
    content:counter(step);
    position:absolute;left:8px;top:8px;
    width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--fire);color:white;font-weight:900;
    font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .order-list.teardown li::before{background:var(--sky);}
  .order-video{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
    background:var(--forest);color:white;
    border-radius:100px;padding:8px 14px;
    font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;
    margin-top:4px;
  }

  /* ---------- Type comparison ---------- */
  .style-switch{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .style-btn{
    flex:1;padding:10px 4px;border-radius:12px;
    border:2px solid var(--forest);background:var(--paper);
    font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--forest);cursor:pointer;
  }
  .style-btn.active{background:var(--forest);color:white;}
  .season-switch{margin-bottom:6px;}
  .season-btn.active[data-gseason="summer"]{background:var(--fire);border-color:var(--fire);}
  .season-btn.active[data-gseason="winter"]{background:var(--sky);border-color:var(--sky);}
  .gear-count{font-size:11.5px;color:#9c9384;margin:0 0 10px;text-align:right;}
  .season-tag{
    display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;
    padding:2px 9px;border-radius:100px;margin-right:5px;
  }
  .season-tag.summer{background:var(--fire-light);color:#5a2d05;}
  .season-tag.winter{background:var(--sky);color:#0d2c33;}
  .season-tag.all{background:var(--canvas-deep);color:var(--forest-dark);}
  table.compare{
    width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;
    background:var(--paper);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;
    font-size:12.5px;
  }
  table.compare th{
    background:var(--forest-dark);color:var(--canvas);
    padding:9px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;
  }
  table.compare td{padding:9px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--canvas-deep);}
  table.compare tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  .priority{font-weight:900;}
  .priority.high{color:var(--fire);}
  .priority.mid{color:var(--sun-dark,#B98A1B);}
  .priority.low{color:#9c9384;}

  /* ---------- Campsite search ---------- */
  .filter-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  select{
    flex:1;min-width:120px;
    border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;
    padding:8px 12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;
    background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
  }
  .site-card{
    background:var(--paper);border-radius:16px;
    padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;
    border:2px solid var(--canvas-deep);
    display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .site-emoji{font-size:30px;}
  .site-card h3{margin:0 0 3px;font-size:15px;color:var(--forest-dark);}
  .site-card .pref{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--sky);font-weight:700;}
  .site-card p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:#5a5344;line-height:1.6;}
  .site-tags{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;}
  .site-tag{background:var(--canvas-deep);font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:100px;color:var(--forest-dark);font-weight:700;}

  footer{
    text-align:center;padding:24px 20px 40px;
    font-size:11px;color:#9c9384;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2L2 21H22L12 2Z" fill="#F4BE3E"/><path d="M12 2L6.5 21H17.5L12 2Z" fill="#E9722C"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="1.4" fill="#2E5942"/></svg>
    <h1>CAMP LAB</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="hero-sub">ギア用語も、設営のコツも、比較も検索も。焚き火の前で開きたくなるキャンプ相棒アプリ。</p>
  <div class="hero-tags">
    <span class="hero-tag">🏕 ソロ〜ファミキャン対応</span>
    <span class="hero-tag">🔥 スタッキング特化</span>
    <span class="hero-tag">🗺 キャンプ場検索</span>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" id="tabs">
  <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="dict">📖 用語辞典</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="gear">🎥 ギア&設営動画</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="fire">🔥 焚き火の組み方</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="rope">🪢 ロープの結び方</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="combo">🧩 スタッキング術</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="compare">⚖️ スタイル別比較</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="site">🗺 キャンプ場検索</button>
</nav>

<main>

  <!-- ============ 辞典 ============ -->
  <section class="panel active" id="panel-dict">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>ギア用語辞典</h2>
    <div class="note-box">🌐「＋ ネットから用語を追加」から、載っていない用語をWikipediaで検索して辞典に追加できます。取得した説明文はその場で編集OK。追加した用語はこの端末に保存され、次回開いた時も残ります。</div>
    <div class="search-box">
      <input id="dictSearch" placeholder="用語を検索(例: タープ)" />
      <button onclick="filterDict()">検索</button>
    </div>
    <button class="add-term-btn" id="openAddForm">＋ ネットから用語を追加</button>

    <div class="add-form" id="addForm">
      <p class="add-form-label">追加したい用語を入力してね</p>
      <input id="newTermInput" placeholder="例: ホットサンドメーカー" />
      <div class="add-form-row">
        <button class="fetch-btn" id="fetchWikiBtn">🌐 ネットから説明を取得</button>
      </div>
      <div id="fetchStatus" class="fetch-status"></div>
      <textarea id="newTermDesc" placeholder="説明文(ネット取得後に編集もOK。自分で入力してもOK)"></textarea>
      <div class="add-form-row">
        <select id="newTermCat">
          <option value="シェルター">シェルター</option>
          <option value="設営小物">設営小物</option>
          <option value="寝具">寝具</option>
          <option value="収納">収納</option>
          <option value="調理">調理</option>
          <option value="家具">家具</option>
          <option value="照明">照明</option>
          <option value="サイト用語">サイト用語</option>
          <option value="その他">その他</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="add-form-row">
        <button class="save-btn" id="saveTermBtn">この用語を辞典に追加</button>
        <button class="cancel-btn" id="cancelAddBtn">キャンセル</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="dictList"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ギア&動画 ============ -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-gear">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>到着後の設営 & 撤収の手順</h2>
    <div class="note-box">🚗 スタイルによって「最初に何を出すか」の正解は変わる。自分のスタイルを選んで、迷わず動ける手順をチェック！</div>
    <div class="style-switch" id="orderStyleSwitch">
      <button class="style-btn active" data-ostyle="solo">ソロキャン</button>
      <button class="style-btn" data-ostyle="group">グルキャン</button>
      <button class="style-btn" data-ostyle="family">ファミキャン</button>
    </div>
    <div id="orderPanel"></div>

    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>種類別ギア & 設営動画</h2>
    <div class="note-box">💡 スタイル(ソロ/グルキャン/ファミキャン)と季節(夏/冬)、両方の条件で絞り込めます。動画リンクはYouTube検索結果に直接飛べるようにしています。</div>
    <div class="style-switch" id="gearStyleSwitch">
      <button class="style-btn active" data-gstyle="all">すべて</button>
      <button class="style-btn" data-gstyle="solo">ソロキャン</button>
      <button class="style-btn" data-gstyle="group">グルキャン</button>
      <button class="style-btn" data-gstyle="family">ファミキャン</button>
    </div>
    <div class="style-switch season-switch" id="gearSeasonSwitch">
      <button class="style-btn season-btn active" data-gseason="all">🍃 オールシーズン込み</button>
      <button class="style-btn season-btn" data-gseason="summer">☀️ 夏ギア</button>
      <button class="style-btn season-btn" data-gseason="winter">❄️ 冬ギア</button>
    </div>
    <p id="gearCount" class="gear-count"></p>
    <div class="gear-grid" id="gearList"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 焚き火の組み方 ============ -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-fire">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>薪割り & 焚き付け作りテクニック</h2>
    <div class="note-box">🪓 焚き付け(火が燃え移りやすい細い木)を自分で作れると、雨上がりで薪が湿っている時にも強くなる。</div>
    <div class="gear-grid" id="craftList"></div>

    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>薪の組み方いろいろ</h2>
    <div class="note-box">🔥 焚き火は「燃料・酸素・熱」の3要素のバランスが命。組み方を変えるだけで火力や燃焼時間が変わるので、その日の目的(暖をとる/調理する/長時間楽しむ)に合わせて選んでみて。</div>
    <div class="gear-grid" id="fireLayList"></div>

    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>着火剤・火口・ファイヤースターター</h2>
    <div class="note-box">⚡ 火起こしが苦手な人はまず固形着火剤から。「あえて苦労を楽しみたい」派はメタルマッチ×麻紐の組み合わせに挑戦してみて。</div>
    <div class="gear-grid" id="fireStarterList"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ロープの結び方 ============ -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-rope">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>タープ・テントで使うロープワーク</h2>
    <div class="note-box">🪢 自在金具が無い時や、強く・美しく張りたい時はロープワークが頼りになる。まずは「もやい結び」と「自在結び」の2つから覚えるのがおすすめ。</div>
    <div class="gear-grid" id="ropeList"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ スタッキング術 ============ -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-combo">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="flag"></span>スタッキングのコツ & おすすめ組み合わせ</h2>
